  "description": "<p>After posting a binary it can no longer be retrieved with the Accept header in the request. The resource is correctly stored and can be retrieved when not using the header:</p>\n\n<p><b>HEAD request</b><br/>\n```<br/>\n$ curl -I -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample<br/>\nHTTP/1.1 200 <br/>\nCache-Control: private<br/>\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=D0E41C7F8D95905DDF60CAF0E308D9FF; Path=/fcrepo; HttpOnly<br/>\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/fcrepo; Max-Age=0; Expires=Wed, 02-Mar-2022 06:07:35 GMT; SameSite=lax<br/>\nETag: \"B362A861CEB9B99E1326226A2F6B2388\"<br/>\nX-State-Token: B362A861CEB9B99E1326226A2F6B2388<br/>\nLast-Modified: Thu, 03 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT<br/>\nAccept-Ranges: bytes<br/>\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"pdf-sample.pdf\"; size=7945; creation-date=\"Thu, 3 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT\"; modification-date=\"Thu, 3 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:metadata\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:metadata</a>&gt;; rel=\"describedby\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample</a>&gt;; rel=\"timegate\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample</a>&gt;; rel=\"original\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:versions</a>&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=