oraAdmin:fedoraAdmin localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample<br/>\nHTTP/1.1 200 <br/>\nCache-Control: no-transform, must-revalidate, max-age=0<br/>\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=670A1EEDDA0528A255CA25DBC69F3424; Path=/fcrepo; HttpOnly<br/>\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/fcrepo; Max-Age=0; Expires=Wed, 02-Mar-2022 06:16:26 GMT; SameSite=lax<br/>\nETag: \"B362A861CEB9B99E1326226A2F6B2388\"<br/>\nX-State-Token: B362A861CEB9B99E1326226A2F6B2388<br/>\nLast-Modified: Thu, 03 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT<br/>\nAccept-Ranges: bytes<br/>\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"pdf-sample.pdf\"; size=7945; creation-date=\"Thu, 3 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT\"; modification-date=\"Thu, 3 Mar 2022 06:07:11 GMT\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:metadata\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:metadata</a>&gt;; rel=\"describedby\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample</a>&gt;; rel=\"timegate\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample</a>&gt;; rel=\"original\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:versions</a>&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Binary\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Binary</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nAccept-External-Content-Handling: copy,redirect,proxy<br/>\nAllow: DELETE,HEAD,GET,PUT,OPTIONS<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8082/fcrepo/rest/dev/pdf-sample/fcr:acl</a>&gt;; rel=\"acl\"<br/>\nContent-Type: application/pdf<br/>\nContent-Length: 7945<br/>\nDate: Thu, 03 Mar 2022 06:16:26 GMT</p>\n\n<p>Warning: Binary output can mess up your terminal. Use \"--output -\" to tell <br/>\nWarning: curl to output it to your terminal anyway, or consider \"--output <br/>\nWarning: &lt;FILE&gt;\" to save to a file.<br/>\n```</p>\n",
